          "_name": "pricing1",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"pricing1\" group=\"Pricing Tables\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\" plugins=\"mobirise-icons2\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"fullWidth\" title=\"Full Width\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"cardColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#fafafa\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n         <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-5\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\"><b>Nội dung chính</b></h4>\n            <div class=\"card col-12 col-lg-6\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"card-box align-left\">\n                        <h6 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\"><b>Phần I: LinkedIn – Vũ Khí Tuyển Dụng Thời Đại Mới</b></h6>\n                        <ul class=\"list mbr-fonts-style mb-5\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".list\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap mb-2\"><b>Bức tranh tuyển dụng 2025</b> - HR cần chuẩn bị gì để không bị bỏ lại?</li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><b>Tối ưu hồ sơ LinkedIn</b> - Bí quyết thu hút ứng viên chất lượng ngay từ trang cá nhân</li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn d-flex justify-content-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-danger\" href=\"index.html#formlead\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Đăng ký ngay</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"card col-12 col-lg-6\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"card-box align-left\">\n                        <h6 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\"><b>Phần II: Săn Ứng Viên Chuẩn – Xây Dựng Thương Hiệu Mạnh</b></h6>\n                        <ul class=\"list mbr-fonts-style mb-5\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".list\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap mb-2\"><b>Tìm kiếm &amp; tiếp cận ứng viên thông minh</b> - Thành thạo kỹ thuật Boolean Search.</li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap mb-2\"><b>Chiến lược Employer Branding</b> – Tăng độ nhận diện, thu hút nhân tài</li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><b>Tạo nội dung thu hút</b> – Biến LinkedIn thành kênh tuyển dụng mạnh mẽ.</li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn d-flex justify-content-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-danger\" href=\"index.html#formlead\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Đăng ký ngay</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
